CeruleanCity_House3_Text_PleaseTradeWithMyHusband::
    .string "My husband likes trading POKéMON.\p"
    .string "You're collecting POKéMON for your\n"
    .string "POKéDEX, aren't you?\p"
    .string "Would you please trade with him?$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_OfferBulbasaur::
    .string "I take care of injured POKéMON.\p"
    .string "I nursed this BULBASAUR back to\l"
    .string "health.\p"
    .string "It needs a good trainer to take\n"
    .string "care of it now.\p"
    .string "If you can prove that by showing\n"
    .string "me a POKéMON with high FRIENDSHIP,\n"
    .string "I would be happy to give\l"
    .string "BULBASAUR to you.$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_FriendshipClear::
    .string "...\p"
    .string "I see you are a kind trainer,\n"
    .string "would you like this BULBASAUR?$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_FriendshipFail::
    .string "Hmm, your lead POKéMON hasn't\n"
    .string "quite warmed up to you enough yet.\p"
    .string "Come back again after spending\l"
    .string "more time with it first.$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_PartyFull::
